        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to &quot;UKNON Jones &amp; Guynelk - Awesome!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Jones' friends were rescued, he discovers that his grandfather has mysteriously disappeared. He was in search of a mythical treasure called the &quot;Crystal Cereals&quot;. Jones, Guynelk, Elsa LOVELUST and princess Saphir decide to go in search of the Crystal Cereal to find Jones' grandfather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9af1e1e3fd5aba2782d5402221f9d129.poster.avif?t=1783407381\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9af1e1e3fd5aba2782d5402221f9d129.webm?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9af1e1e3fd5aba2782d5402221f9d129.mp4?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore an open world with beautiful graphics, alone or with a friend in split screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use the power of time to modify the environment by traveling in the past or future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Face increasingly difficult bosses and discover their weaknesses. -Participate in various mini-games or compete with your friends in this game created by a single person. -Summon allies or make skins appear using a QR code to help you in this adventure rich in events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Go on romantic dates with certain characters in the game by offering them roses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Create your own levels in the level editor or play 4 players in confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/532539f67bbf164d4123f18184dbf5f4.poster.avif?t=1783407381\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/532539f67bbf164d4123f18184dbf5f4.webm?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/532539f67bbf164d4123f18184dbf5f4.mp4?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The adventure can be lived with four different characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Jones (The boy with his archaeologist hat)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Guynelk (The guy with his mustache and beard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Elsa LOVELUST (The sexy nymph with red hair)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Saphir (The princess with her crown and blue hair)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/1f7b8a4f981082d51ca23ca3430f32a9.poster.avif?t=1783407381\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/1f7b8a4f981082d51ca23ca3430f32a9.webm?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/1f7b8a4f981082d51ca23ca3430f32a9.mp4?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character having specific skills. For example, Jones can use bombs or a drone to stun enemies and monitor the surroundings. Guynelk masters elemental powers such as fire, ice, or electricity. Elsa can fly and attack from a distance, while Saphir excels in sword techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9ac765bb872d7d762a77688101e04ded.poster.avif?t=1783407381\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9ac765bb872d7d762a77688101e04ded.webm?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899300/extras/9ac765bb872d7d762a77688101e04ded.mp4?t=1783407381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains summaries in the side quests or in the character gallery, so playing the first game is not required to understand the story as a whole.</p>",
